> Title: Development 1.0.0
> Note: This is the Development release of 1.0.0, this contains untested features, and stuff that may be removed from the release of 1.0.0.

> What does this release contain:
- Vehicles
    - Added `Northstar W-200`
        * Type: Pickup
        * Armour: None
        * Seats: 2
        * Top Speed: 90 Km/h (55 mph)
        * Attributes:
            * Has the ability to have PKM mounted on the bed
    - Added `Haldor 940`
        * Type: Sedan
        * Armour: None
        * Seats: 4
        * Top Speed: 160 Km/h (99 mph)
        * Attributes: None
    - Added `Humvee`
        * Type: SUV
        * Armour: Light
        * Seats: 4
        * Top Speed: 113 Km/h (70 mph)
        * Attributes: None
    - Added `BTR-80`
        * Type: Armoured Personnel Carrier (APC)
        * Armour: Heavy
        * Seats: 10
        * Top Speed: 80 Km/h (50 mph)
        * Attributes:
            * Can go into Water (Top Speed: 9 Km/h (5 mph))
    - Added `Bell UH-1`
        * Type: Helicopter
        * Armour: None
        * Seats: 6
        * Top Speed: ~220 Km/h (~137 mph)
        * Attributes: None
- Firearms
    - Added `Glock 17`
        * Type: Pistol
        * Muzzle Velocity: ~375 m/s (~1,230 ft/s)
        * Base Magazine Capacity: 17 rounds
        * Max Effective Range: ~50m (~55 yd)
        * Attributes: None
    - Added `AK 47`
        * Type: Rifle
        * Muzzle Velocity: ~715 m/s (~2,346 ft/s)
        * Base Magazine Capacity: 30 rounds
        * Max Effective Range: ~350m (~383 yd)
        * Attributes: None
    - Added `PKM`
        * Type: Light Machine Gun (LMG)
        * Muzzle Velocity: ~825 m/s (~2,707 ft/s)
        * Base Magazine Capacity: 100 rounds
        * Max Effective Range: ~1,000m (~1,094 yd)
        * Attributes: None
    - Added `R11 RSASS`
        * Type: Sniper Rifle
        * Muzzle Velocity: ~790 m/s (~2,592 ft/s)
        * Base Magazine Capacity: 20 rounds
        * Max Effective Range: ~800m (~875 yd)
        * Attributes: None
    - Added `RPG-7`
        * Type: Explosive
        * Max Effective Range (Average): ~200 m/s (~219 yd)
        * Supported Rockets: HEAT, FRAG, and Thermobaric
        * Rocket Speed (Average): ~294 m/s (~965 ft/s)
- NPCs
    - Added `Civilian`
    - Added `Zombies`
        * Types: Normal, Radioactive
    - Added `Bandits`
    - Added `Traders`
        * Types: Shop
- General Gameplay Enhancements
    - Server will now be able to handle more then 15 players at the same time
    - The game will now adjust it's rendering of all elements of the game based on FPS
- General Player
    - Added `Inventory Weight` (Measured in Kg)
    - Added `Blood` (Measured in mL)
    - Added `Stamina` (Affected by `Inventory Weight`)
    - Added `Radioactivity` (Measured in mSv/h)
    - Added `Squads`
        * You can now Invite people through the lobby or active in game.
        * This will highlight them on the map.
    - Added `Proximity Chat` & `Radios`
        * Radios are operationable through Voice Chat or Chat Messages.
    - Added `Character Creation` / `Character Customization`
        * New players must create their Character for the first time.
        * Active Players can customize their character in the lobby
        * This only provides support for doing:
            * Hair & Beard
            * Gender
